  "limits": [
    "This independent table comes from one modeling paper and its py2ipa-based pronunciation convention. It does not independently reproduce Lin, Mei or Cai's diction recommendations.",
    "Pinyin r is represented here as a voiced retroflex fricative /ʐ/; the original Chromalect candidate uses a retroflex approximant notation /ɻ/. Neither is promoted as canonical by this document.",
